description_long:
Use for example as:
FileInfo file = new FileInfo(Manifest.RootDirectoryPath + "\\file.py");
Token[] tokens = Tokenizer.ParseFile(file.FullName);
Block block = Lexer.Parse(tokens);
Dictionary<string, object> context = [];
// do anything with the main block
foreach (IStatement statement in block.statements) {
    statement.Execute(context);
}

The context may contain predefined classes or imports.
